{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-06-01 13:41:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL HOSTS NATIONWIDE VOLUNTEER EVENTS IN PARTNERSHIP WITH FEEDING AMERICA® TO HELP PEOPLE EXPERIENCING HUNGER', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL (NYSE: AMP) IN PARTNERSHIP WITH FEEDING AMERICA®, IS BRINGING TOGETHER ITS EMPLOYEES, ADVISORS AND CLIENTS TO MAKE A COLLECTIVE IMPACT IN THE MISSION TO END HUNGER. AS PART OF THE COMPANY'S TWICE-ANNUAL NATIONAL DAYS OF SERVICE, AMERIPRISE VOLUNTEERS WILL PACK MEAL KITS, STOCK SHELVES, SORT FOOD AND HOST VIRTUAL FOOD DRIVES TO SUPPORT THE NEARLY 34 MILLION PEOPLE IN AMERICA – INCLUDING NINE MILLION CHILDREN – EXPERIENCING HUNGER. “AS THE CALEND."}